// A durable power of attorney for finances, from Helen Brooks to Marcus Brooks (poa.md).
Document "poa.md"

Fact person Identified by Helen, Marcus
Placeholder agent For person
Placeholder third For person
Fact usd Identified by Money(USD, 2)
Param gift-limit : Money(USD, 2) = 50000

// P.1, P.4, P.5: when the agent has authority
Bool signed
Bool revoked
Bool deceased
Bool incapacitated
Event loses-capacity Creates incapacitated()
Event regains-capacity Terminates incapacitated()
Event death Creates deceased()
Bool authority
  Holds when signed() && Not(revoked()) && Not(deceased())
Act sign Actor person
  Holds when person == Helen
  Creates signed()
Power revoke Actor person
  Holds when person == Helen && authority() && Not(incapacitated())
  Valid when person == Helen && authority() && Not(incapacitated())
  Creates revoked()

// P.6: whom a dealing binds
Fact notice Identified by third
Act give-notice Actor person Recipient third
  Holds when signed() && Not(authority())
  Creates notice()
Fact binding Identified by agent * third
  Holds when agent == Marcus && signed() && (authority() || Not(notice()))

// P.2, P.3: what the agent may do
Fact dealt Identified by third * usd
Fact unrecorded Identified by third * usd
Power pay Actor agent Recipient third Related to usd
  Holds when agent == Marcus && authority()
  Valid when binding()
  Creates dealt(), unrecorded()
Power transfer Actor agent Recipient third Related to usd
  Holds when agent == Marcus && authority()
  Valid when binding()
  Creates dealt(), unrecorded()
Power give Actor agent Recipient third Related to usd
  Holds when agent == Marcus && authority() && usd <= gift-limit
  Valid when binding() && usd <= gift-limit
  Creates dealt(), unrecorded()
Fact account
Function beneficiary Identified by account * person
Power change-beneficiary Actor person Related to account, person'
  Holds when person == Helen
  Valid when person == Helen
  Creates beneficiary(account, person')

// P.7: records and the account
Act record Actor agent Related to third, usd
  Holds when agent == Marcus && unrecorded()
  Terminates unrecorded()
Duty account-due Holder agent Claimant person
  Due within 30
  Created by request-account
  Terminated by give-account
Act request-account Actor person Recipient agent
  Holds when person == Helen && agent == Marcus
Act give-account Actor agent Recipient person
  Conditioned by Not(Exists unrecorded: unrecorded)

Clause P.1 Approved "5c246399a0ec1192a019649ecb8c585091402ec2f3efda37134b813169e274dd"
  Norm "I, Helen Brooks, the principal, appoint Marcus Brooks as my agent for my finances. This power of attorney takes effect when I sign it." => sign
Clause P.2 Approved "d84e6d97d4eb4bf7530f510579635f47fe2d776a40bc1807591331588bf295b2"
  Norm "The agent may pay my bills and move money between my accounts." => pay, transfer
  Norm " What the agent does within this authority binds me as if I had done it myself." => pay, transfer, give
Clause P.3 Approved "0a48dbc8e6630e53df94d91174228ae87005195dbfc8ee529516142aa2439f6a"
  Norm "The agent may make a gift of my money of no more than five hundred dollars. A larger gift does not bind me." => give
  Norm " The agent may not change the beneficiary of any account. An attempt by the agent to do so has no effect." => change-beneficiary
Clause P.4 Approved "6fec6296a1baf8beef83a61d08f5f672b7216fa8421517e27befc36dee409c58"
  Definition "This power of attorney is durable."
  Norm " The agent's authority continues while I am incapacitated." => pay, transfer, give
Clause P.5 Approved "ae98a074c0667864e190017cf9842b93f56de71f5bd3cb4e558bd9bd3ce7f0f4"
  Norm "I may revoke this power of attorney at any time while I have capacity." => revoke
  Norm " The agent's authority ends when I revoke it, and it ends at my death." => pay, transfer, give
Clause P.6 Approved "87157423e7c24615db697d048530ab64a20a7bfd8ae6063d02e376091ac92bec"
  Norm "A person who deals with the agent without notice that the agent's authority has ended is protected: the dealing binds me or my estate. Once that person has notice, it does not." => give-notice, pay, transfer, give
Clause P.7 Approved "d566021308511f942543588094ad69ef91321bec87879168537d016ee57d15dd"
  Norm "The agent keeps a record of every payment, transfer and gift made for me." => record
  Norm " The agent gives me an account of them within thirty days of my request." => request-account, account-due, give-account
.
